id=bt_hires_mixer
name=BT Hi-Res Mixer (NX809J)
version=v0.3.0
versionCode=4
author=XPRAMT
description=BT A2DP hi-res mixer for NX809J: per-rate deep-buffer mix ports plus a one-instruction audio policy patch so 44.1/48 kHz tracks pick the output with their own rate. Overlays audio_module_config_primary.xml and libaudiopolicymanagerdefault.so.
